        "Content": "Light drenched, double fronted, substantial semi detached family home with ample off - street parking for a number of cars. \r\nSuper mature gardens to rear with side entrance, extremely private aspect, two patio areas and wooden shed.\r\nHigh ceilings  -  c2.7m on ground floor and c2.55m  on first floor of original house enhance the spacious feel of this home.\r\nRecently fitted ensuite to master bedroom. \r\n-  Guest cloakroom.  \r\n-  Phonewatch alarm system ( recently installed) \r\n-  Most original doors and picture rails. \r\n-  Mostly vPVC double glazed windows/ doors and some single glazed windows some with secondary glazing. \r\n-  Gas fired central heating with new boiler installed in 2025. \r\n-  Enviable position in a highly sought after, prestigious residential area."
